  "text": "Around them, the room filled with the sound of new beginnings. Chairs scraping, families calling with last instructions, staff passing out indigo folders stamped with a copper heron. Through the tall windows, McCall-Hart University glowed honey-gold in the morning light. Malik had studied the campus map for two weeks, but a map had not prepared him for how old and alive the place felt. Nia tilted her head toward his screen. Do you need help? His first instinct was no. His second was also no, but with better manners. I can fix it, he said. I didn't ask if you could. That answer stayed with him longer than it should have.",
